# Auto commit and deploy

After finishing a user-requested app change (not a question-only turn):

1. Commit the relevant files with a concise message that explains why.
2. Push `main` to `origin` so Vercel production updates. Do not wait to be asked.

Do not commit `.env.local`, secrets, or unrelated files. Do not skip git hooks. Do not amend unless the user asks.

If push or deploy fails, say so and stop.
